Third-party software
--------------------

The four office engines in versions/<set>/web/ (WordCraft, GridCraft, DeckCraft and PdfCraft) are
open-source Crafting Apps by the ArtCraft team and contributors (https://github.com/storytold), each
licensed under MIT or Apache-2.0. Their own LICENSE-MIT, LICENSE-APACHE and NOTICE files ship inside
each app folder and apply to those files. The ArtCraft name and the logos from the engines'
docs/brand/ folders are trademarks of their owners and are not part of this repository.

The fonts (Inter, DM Mono) are installed from npm (Fontsource) under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.
npm dependencies keep their own licenses, see node_modules/<package>/LICENSE after npm install.
